{"id":"vskryt_","lemma":"вскрыть","pos":"verb","rank":4811,"glosses":["to open, to unseal","to reveal, to bring to light, to disclose, to uncover, to expose","to dissect, to make a postmortem, to perform an autopsy on"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bf/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%BA%D1%80%D1%8B%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%BA%D1%80%D1%8B%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"вскрою","2s":"вскроешь","3s":"вскроет","1p":"вскроем","2p":"вскроете","3p":"вскроют"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"вскрой","2p":"вскройте"}}},"past":{"m":"вскрыл","p":"вскрыли","f":"вскрыла","n":"вскрыло"},"examples":[{"text":"Я вскрыл конверт.","en":"I opened the envelope.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/650067","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"envelope"}]},{"text":"Я только что вскрыл его.","en":"I just opened it.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,null,{"g":"him / his"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"just, just now"]]},{"text":"Том попытался вскрыть ящик.","en":"Tom tried to pry open the box.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to attempt, to try","l":"попытаться"},null,{"g":"box, case, chest"}]},{"text":"Кто вскрыл этот пакет?","en":"Who tore this package open?","words":[{"g":"who"},null,{"g":"this/that one"},{"g":"small bag, parcel"}]},{"text":"Я вскрою посылку.","en":"I'm going to unwrap the package.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null]}]}